      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request path",
      "items": [
        "Caddy serves the site and HTTPS; only ports 80/443 are open",
        "API checks every request against its owner",
        "Uploads go to S3; a job is queued in PostgreSQL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Reading pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Text from PyMuPDF or Tesseract OCR",
        "Groq returns strict JSON; the AI only reads",
        "Code decides: ranges, unreadable values, dates"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Security",
      "items": [
        "No access keys: the server uses an IAM role",
        "Database private, reachable only from the server",
        "Secrets never in Terraform; email via Amazon SES (off for now)"
      ]
